305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (AI-generated image synthesis with GANs and diffusion models has transformed digital media but also threatens to cause risks such as misinformation and identity theft. Texture-based analysis provides a strong method for identifying AI-generated images by detecting subtle structural patterns finer than pixel intensity. GLCM, LBP, and wavelet transforms, as well as deep learning embeddings, improve detection accuracy. To facilitate research in this area, we present the Real vs AI-Generated Image Texture Feature Dataset, consisting of pre-extracted texture features for training and testing machine and deep learning models to detect AI-generated content, with applications in AI ethics, cybersecurity, and forensic analysis.)
/E (AI-generated image synthesis with GANs and diffusion models has transformed digital media but also threatens to cause risks such as misinformation and identity theft. Texture-based analysis provides a strong method for identifying AI-generated images by detecting subtle structural patterns finer than pixel intensity. GLCM, LBP, and wavelet transforms, as well as deep learning embeddings, improve detection accuracy. To facilitate research in this area, we present the Real vs AI-Generated Image Texture Feature Dataset, consisting of pre-extracted texture features for training and testing machine and deep learning models to detect AI-generated content, with applications in AI ethics, cybersecurity, and forensic analysis.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
